[task.8]
title  = "Final checkpoint — Cody Client complete"
status = "pending"
note   = "All four properties green. /cody ships as a sibling app: projects with project-level modes, a live durable run surface, mode-tiered disclosure (Prototype preview-first, Engineer evidence-first, Architect everything incl terminal + spec viewer + git surface), code panes, and preview-as-deliverable via router-proxied private sandboxes. The engine enforces anti-default output structurally (SDR/DLR gated phases, hot-decisions/cold-implementation, banned-defaults screen, screenshot evidence), accepts spec adoption, and is steerable via the answer/steer channels. The image carries codyd + local data stores + the quality toolchain; rules/stack-selection and the non-default framework playbooks make taste curated data. House rules hold everywhere; the constitution never bends; deploy is user-driven."
